   "body": "**mac/mac-mbp**: round 1 fixed in d780272a (one commit, tests and PR body only; no app code changed). Author w1310 (Sonnet 5.5).\n\n1. Done: `aRefreshRefusedUnderAnOpenComposerPlaysNothingAndSendsNothing` opens a composer (`composer(.reply, isOpen: true)`), runs the refresh, expects no haptic and no request. Red when both `!refuses` guards are made ineffective (`let refuses = false`): fails at `recorder.played.isEmpty`.\n2. Done: `### Ledger` `gap-edit` on GAP-1207's SwiftHFR final cell (start impact, completion impact, #1310). `ledger.py check-body --file <body> --pr 1321`: \"1 block(s) ok\".\n3. Done: `anEmptyAnswerStillPlaysOneImpact` (empty `TopicListPage`). Red with `if arrived, !(loader.value?.topics.isEmpty ?? true)`: `recorder.played == [light]` fails.\n4. Acknowledged, no change (same count).\n\nRun on iPhone 18 Pro iOS 27.2, unsigned: red3 (both mutations) 2 issues in LegacyHapticsTests; green2 (LegacyHapticsTests, ReaderBottomBarTests, ForumSearchModelTests, ReaderComposerSuspensionTests) TEST SUCCEEDED. A first red attempt did not compile (unused `refuses`), so it counted for nothing and was redone. pre-commit passed, no line over 140. PR stays draft.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_\n",
