   "body": "**mac/mac-mbp**: adversarial review round 2, reviewer r1321 (Opus 5.5), author w1310 (Sonnet 5.5).\n\n**Adversarial review (Opus 5.5, r1321, head d780272a)**\n\n**APPROVE**\n\n1. Composer refusal, fixed. `aRefreshRefusedUnderAnOpenComposerPlaysNothingAndSendsNothing` (`LegacyHapticsTests.swift:151-162`) opens a reply composer (`reader.composer(.reply, isOpen: true)`, which `suspendsPageInteractions` checks) and asserts no request and no impact. It passes in `green2.log` and fails at `:161` in `red3.out`, while the request assertion holds.\n2. GAP-1207, fixed. The `gap-edit` replaces only `SwiftHFR final`, keeps the row's text, and adds the completion impact (#1310), as `ReaderPageEnd.swift:91` does. `check-body`: 1 block ok.\n3. Empty answer, fixed. `anEmptyAnswerStillPlaysOneImpact` fails at `:82` under the empty-skip mutation.\n\nNo new findings. SwiftLint by reading: no line over 140, about 36 lines in the struct and 115 in the extension, no trailing comma.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_\n",
